2 gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-orange-700\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-yellow-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                        Rajkot Service Benefits\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <li><b>Local reach</b> serving Kalavad Road, Mavdi, and 150 Feet Ring Road.</li>\n                        <li><b>Qualified technicians</b> experienced in Metoda and Shapar industrial AC.</li>\n                        <li><b>Genuine replacement parts</b> to ensure multi-brand system durability.</li>\n                        <li><b>Honest pricing</b> with standard labor and component charges.</li>\n                        <li><b>Quick response</b> for emergency breakdowns in Rajkot industrial estates.</li>\n                        <li><b>Specialized cleaning</b> for heavy dust removal in high-traffic city areas.</li>\n                        <li><b>Comprehensive warranty</b> on all PCB and compressor troubleshooting.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-orange-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-blue-900\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-orange-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"></path></svg>\n                        AC Risks in Rajkot\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>Semi-arid climate leads to <b>frequent compressor overheating</b>.</li>\n                        <li>High dust levels cause <b>indoor unit water leakage</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Low refrigerant levels result in <b>low cooling efficiency</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Using duplicate parts leads to <b>repeated system failure</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Blocked filters reduce <b>indoor air quality</b> significantly.</li>\n                        <li>Untreated electrical issues cause <b>fan motor burnouts</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Neglected maintenance results in <b>high electricity consumption</b>.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Rajkot Product Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-blue-900\">Which Types of Products We Repair</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">Complete cooling maintenance for homes and industrial sectors in Rajkot.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Window-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Window AC Repair Rajkot\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/window-ac-service-rajkot\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Window AC Service</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Full <b>window ac repair</b> including gas refill and deep coil cleaning.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/window-ac-service-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Rajkot</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/chiller-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Chiller Repair Rajkot\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Chiller Repair</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Industrial <b>chiller maintenance</b> for Rajkot and Metoda GIDC plants.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Rajkot</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/advance-panel-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Panel AC Repair Rajkot\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/panel-ac-service-rajkot\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Panel AC Repair</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Crucial <b>panel ac service</b> for sensitive electronic plant cabinets.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Rajkot</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-16 h-16 text-yellow-500 mb-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 