amakrishna Ashram</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 border-b border-blue-700 pb-2\">Industrial Zones</h3>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-sm text-blue-200\">\n                    <span>Metoda GIDC</span> <span>Shapar-Veraval GIDC</span> <span>Lodhika GIDC</span> <span>Aji Vasahat GIDC</span>\n                    <span>Rajkot Industrial Estate</span> <span>Kuwadva Road Industrial Area</span> <span>Hadamtala GIDC</span> <span>Atika Industrial Area</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Gujarat City Presence Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-orange-600\">Gujarat City Presence</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-ahmedabad\" class=\"bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 p-4 text-center rounded hover:bg-yellow-400 transition font-bold\">Ahmedabad</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-vadodara\" class=\"bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 p-4 text-center rounded hover:bg-yellow-400 transition font-bold\">Vadodara</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-surat\" class=\"bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 p-4 text-center rounded hover:bg-yellow-400 transition font-bold\">Surat</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-anand\" class=\"bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 p-4 text-center rounded hover:bg-yellow-400 transition font-bold\">Anand</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-bharcuh\" class=\"bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 p-4 text-center rounded hover:bg-yellow-400 transition font-bold\">Bharuch</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-gujarat\" class=\"col-span-2 lg:col-span-1 bg-orange-600 text-white p-4 text-center rounded hover:bg-orange-700 transition font-bold shadow-lg\">Gujarat All</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Rajkot FAQs -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-blue-900\">Rajkot Service FAQs</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the cost of AC service in Rajkot?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A professional <b>ac jet service</b> in Rajkot starts from ₹599. Detailed rates for gas charging and repairs are in our <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"underline\">full price list</a>.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you serve Kalavad Road and Metoda GIDC?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide <b>fast ac repair</b> across Kalavad Road residential areas and have a dedicated team for Metoda GIDC factories.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Can you fix central AC for industries in Shapar?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Absolutely. <b>Atlas Aircon</b> provides specialized <b>chiller repair services</b> and heavy-duty <b>hvac maintenance</b> for industrial setups in Shapar-Veraval GIDC.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What brands of AC do you repair in Rajkot?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer <b>multi-brand ac repair</b> for all leading names including LG, Samsung, Daikin, Blue Star, Carrier, Voltas, and Hitachi.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Is gas charging available for all AC types in Rajkot?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide <b>ac gas charging</b> for window, split, cassette, and ductable systems using R32, R410, and R22 refrigerants.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you offer repair for inverter PCB boards in Rajkot?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our technicians are specialists in <b>inverter pcb repair</b>, ensuring your advanced cooling system is restored without a full board replacement.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How long does a standard AC service take?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A professional <b>ac jet wash service</b> usually takes between 45 to 90 minutes per unit to ensure peak efficiency.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you use original copper pipes for Rajkot repairs?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we strictly use high-grade <b>genuine copper pipe for ac</b> to ensure maximum heat exchange and leak protection for Saurashtra&#8217;s heat.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the warranty on Rajkot repairs?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We provide a standard <b>service warranty</b> on labor and a standard duration warranty on various <b>ac spare parts</b> like motors and capacitors.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How can I book an Atlas Aircon technician in Rajkot?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Booking is easy. Click the <b>WhatsApp button</b> on our banner or call our Rajkot service desk directly at <b>+91 97272 57141</b>.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-blue-900 text-white py-12 border-t-4 border-yellow-400\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12\">\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon Rajkot\" class=\"h-12 mb-6\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"text-yellow-100\">Professional <b>AC repair Rajkot</b> and industrial cooling experts. Reliable cooling solutions for the Saurashtra region.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">Rajkot Helpline</h4>\n                <p class=\"mb-2\">Call: +91 97272 57141</p>\n                <p>Location: Rajkot, Gujarat</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">Quick Menu</h4>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm text-yellow-100\">\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-rajkot\" class=\"hover:underline\">AC Repair</a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-vadodara\" class=\"hover:underline\">Vadodara</a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-service-rajkot\" class=\"hover:underline\">AC Service</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"border-t border-blue-800 mt-12 pt-8 text-center text-blue-200 text-sm italic\">\n            &copy; 2024 Atlas Aircon. Dedicated AC Service in Rajkot &#038; Saurashtra.\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n</div>",
